            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Bonnie Thielmier"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I didn't have tomato juice so I added more tomato sauce. I also added a can of rotel tomatoes (for some kick), stewed tomatoes, a can of tomato paste, basil, oregano, and thyme. I had to adjust by adding a small amount of water for consistency. It was GREAT! The addition of parsley was a bonus...",
